e CI runs and the local logs named in contract \u00a710, not these commands. The cluster leg's ssh, build and artifact-pull phases have still never executed on real members (every Instant Cluster create was refused; the two-pods transport is a separate unit, unrun live). The chaos leg's crash-window test is red on the tip's CI runs and on main's (pre-existing, advisory). The jobs row `already_transferred_gang_is_never_bound` submits is not removed by the test wrapper (pre-existing). `CatalogClusterState::init` seeds every row's cache timestamp with 'now' (pre-existing; one scheduler per fleet today).", "ts": "2026-09-16T19:34:20.022051+00:00", "unit_branch": "feat/500-wave4"}
